gram of total  aflatoxin  and shown below that is the aflatest  wbasr plus column  some of the advantages of the afla test  wbsr plus immunoaffinity column are  listed here  high performance  the aflatest wbsr plus method exceeds  aoac method performance requirements  giving  greater than 90 mean recovery of  aflatoxins b1 b2 g1 and g2  in both grains  corn wheat notes and difficult to  analyze food matrices such as chili  cocoa and traditional chinese medicine  the column and the method is  comprehensive  bicam's aflates wbsr plus immunoaffinity  column binds aflatoxin b1 b2 g1 and g2  as well as aflatoxin m1 m2 and stc  the method is flexible it's one  standardized method that is suitable for  a wide range of different commodities  it also has a wide testing range  aflatest wb sr plus can detect total  aflatoxin levels from  0.05  nanogram to 500 nanograms  with recoveries greater than 90 percent  the aflatest wb sr plus  method exceeds aoac method performance  requirements and shows that it is  capable of getting excellent recoveries  on both grains  and complex sample matrices  it is fast and easy  the uplc option provides an opportunity  to shorten the analytical runtime and  the use of a large flow cell in the  fluorescence detector  eliminates the need for post column  derivatization  and lastly we have overall performance  these methods have the desired  sensitivity selectivity  and overall performance that is  used to check compliance with regulatory  limits for aflatoxins  in a wide range of crops  and foods  what vicam delivers vicam delivers  testing options and programs to monitor  mycotoxins in a wide variety of  commodities  we are dedicated to ensure that our food  supply is mycotoxin free and safe for  human and animal consumption  i would like to thank you so very much  for joining me today  and for your interest in  the new technologies for complex  matrices and solving some of the  difficult challenges that occur when  analyzing difficult matrices  i hope that you have found this  particularly helpful  and that you will join us in the future  for other  topics  thank you so much
 

